  "_comment": [
    "The community package, as a ratchet. `retained` is every source file in",
    "veodyn_api/, and `moved` is every module the enterprise pack took.",
    "tests/test_ce_has_no_ee_code.py holds both to the tree, so an enterprise",
    "module cannot be re-added quietly and this file cannot go stale into a",
    "number nobody updates. Same shape and intent as the frontend's own",
    "app/scripts/enterprise-paths.mjs, which app/scripts/check-ce-tree.mjs reads.",
    "Adding a community module is one line here and is meant to be a decision."
